# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:238
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.0"
msgid "放置紫晶塔！它能瞬间吸收周边器械的光并输出不同频率的光。"
msgstr ""
"Place an Amethyst Pylon! It instantly absorbs light from nearby contraptions "
"and outputs light of different frequencies."

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:241
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.1"
msgid ""
"用触发器驱动紫晶塔来切换它输出的光颜色！也可以通过放置不同颜色的器械来调色！"
msgstr ""
"Use a Trigger to drive the Amethyst Pylon and switch the color of light it "
"outputs! You can also mix colors by placing contraptions of different colors!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:244
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.2"
msgid ""
"亡魂战士只能被<color=#FF0000>红</color>光或<color=#FFD700>黄</color>光照亮，"
"调出对应颜色击败它！"
msgstr ""
"Wraith Warriors can only be revealed by <color=#FF0000>Red</color> light or "
"<color=#FFD700>Yellow</color> light. Tune to the right color and defeat them!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:247
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.3"
msgid ""
"亡魂弓箭手只能被<color=#00FF00>绿</color>光或<color=#00FFFF>青</color>光照"
"亮！"
msgstr ""
"Wraith Archers can only be revealed by <color=#00FF00>Green</color> light or "
"<color=#00FFFF>Cyan</color> light!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:250
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.4"
msgid ""
"亡魂狂战士只能被<color=orange>橙</color>光或<color=grey>白</color>光照亮！"
msgstr ""
"Wraith Berserkers can only be revealed by <color=orange>Orange</color> light "
"or <color=grey>White</color> light!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:253
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.5"
msgid "亡魂冲锋者只能被<color=blue>蓝</color>光照亮！"
msgstr ""
"Wraith Vanguards can only be revealed by <color=blue>Blue</color> light!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:256
msgctxt "advice.amethyst_tutorial.6"
msgid ""
"亡魂无头只能被<color=#FF0000>红</color>光或<color=purple>紫</color>光照亮！"
msgstr ""
"Wraith Dullahans can only be revealed by <color=#FF0000>Red</color> light or "
"<color=purple>Purple</color> light!"

# 教程关指引
#: Scripts\Vanilla\GameContent\Stages\Definitions\AmethystTutorial.cs:259
