#. Description for music mvz2:mainmenu
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"主界面，以及关卡前对话的音乐。\n"
"很经典的音乐，我就不多作评价了。\n"
"请好好享受这音乐，并怀念2009年的快乐吧。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the main menu and the pre-level dialogue.\n"
"It’s a classic piece, so I won’t elaborate much on it.\n"
"Please enjoy the song and take a moment to reminisce about the joy of 2009."

