#. Name for music mvz2:halloween
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "莱克死灵之书-关卡"
msgstr "Lexonomicon Level"

#. Source for music mvz2:halloween
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "书虫大冒险"
msgstr "Bookworm Adventures"

#. Description for music mvz2:halloween
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"永夜沼泽关卡的音乐。\n"
"出自宝开之前的另一款佳作《书虫大冒险》，制作十分精良，可惜人气实在太低，并且"
"由于强绑定英文而无法走向世界。\n"
"实在是太可惜了。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels in Halloween.\n"
"It originates from another excellent game by PopCap, <i>Bookworm Adventures</"
"i>. The production quality is superb, but unfortunately, its popularity was "
"far too low, and its strong reliance on English prevented it from reaching a "
"global audience.\n"
"What a pity."

#. Name for music mvz2:halloween_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "莱克死灵之书-地图"
msgstr "Lexonomicon Map"

#. Description for music mvz2:halloween_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"永夜沼泽地图的音乐。\n"
"那么这系列音乐原来使用在什么地方呢？\n"
"《书虫大冒险》的主角Lex是一只书虫，负责管理大图书馆中的书籍。它先后穿梭于希腊"
"神话、埃及神话，以及欧洲鬼怪故事这三本书中。\n"
"而这首音乐则来自于第三本书——欧洲鬼怪故事中。其游戏内的名称即为《莱克死灵之"
"书》，是Lex的名字和《死灵之书》的组合词。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Halloween.\n"
"So, where was this series of this theme originally used?\n"
"The protagonist of <i>Bookworm Adventures</i>, Lex, is a bookworm tasked "
"with managing the books in the Great Library. Lex travels through three "
"books: Greek Mythology, Egyptian Mythology, and European Monster Stories.\n"
"This theme comes from the third book—European Monster Stories. Its in-game "
"title is <i>Lexonomicon</i>, a portmanteau of Lex's name and <i>The "
"Necronomicon</i>."

#. Name for music mvz2:minigame
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "狂人的愉悦"
msgstr "Loonboon"

#. Description for music mvz2:minigame
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"小游戏的音乐。\n"
"紧张又刺激的小游戏来了。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the mini-games.\n"
"Get ready—Here comes the tense and thrilling mini-games!"

#. Name for music mvz2:ultimate_battle
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "终极之战"
msgstr "Ultimate Battle"

#. Description for music mvz2:ultimate_battle
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"永夜沼泽最终关的音乐。\n"
"原来是大部分传送带关卡都会播放的音乐，在这里只用于永夜沼泽。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Halloween.\n"
"Originally, this track played in most conveyor belt levels, but here it is "
"exclusively used for Halloween."

#. Name for music mvz2:halloween_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "莱克死灵之书-头目"
msgstr "Lexonomicon Boss"

#. Description for music mvz2:halloween_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"科学怪人的怪物的音乐。\n"
"《莱克死灵之书》这本书中包括了大量的欧洲鬼怪，当然也包括科学怪人弗兰肯斯坦和"
"他的造物。\n"
"《科学怪人》是一本知名的科幻恐怖小说，书中的科学怪人弗兰肯斯坦创造了一个尸块"
"怪物，在它活过来之后，却因为对它恐惧而逃离了他。\n"
"怪物最初并不邪恶，但在接连的敌意和冷漠下逐渐扭曲了自己的心。它最终发狂，和它"
"的创造者弗兰肯斯坦同归于尽。\n"
"呵呵，你可否想到自己？史蒂夫？"
msgstr ""
"The theme for Frankenstein's Monster.\n"
"The <i>Lexonomicon</i> features a plethora of European monsters, including, "
"of course, Frankenstein and his creature.\n"
"<i>Frankenstein</i> is a renowned science fiction horror novel. In the "
"story, the scientist Victor Frankenstein creates a monster from stitched-"
"together body parts. However, upon bringing it to life, he is horrified by "
"his creature and abandons it.\n"
"The monster is not inherently evil, but it becomes twisted by relentless "
"hostility and indifference. Ultimately, it descends into madness, leading to "
"a tragic end where both the monster and its creator, Frankenstein, perish "
"together.\n"
"Heh, does this remind you of yourself, Steve?"

#. Name for music mvz2:thread
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "thread(沉思)"
msgstr "thread"

#. Source for music mvz2:thread
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "暮色森林"
msgstr "The Twilight Forest"

#. Description for music mvz2:thread
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"永夜沼泽拓展关的音乐。\n"
"EXPAND gms2版本的永夜沼泽分波音乐也选用了这首曲子。\n"
"初听没什么意思，听着听着就听出了韵味，我脑中也不时会响起这首曲子。\n"
"听上去像是一个神秘的法师在他的花园中闲庭漫步，思考着符文与法术。"
msgstr ""
"The music for the Eternal Night Swamp EXPAND Level.\n"
"The EXPAND gms2 version also uses this track for its wave-based soundtrack "
"in the Eternal Night Swamp.\n"
"It doesn't leave much of an impression at first, but the more you listen, "
"the more its charm reveals itself. I often find this piece playing in my "
"head.\n"
"It sounds like a mysterious mage strolling through his garden, lost in "
"thought over runes and spells."

#. Name for music mvz2:dream_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "破碎的童话-关卡"
msgstr "Fractured Fairytales Level"

#. Source for music mvz2:dream_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "书虫大冒险 Vol.2"
msgstr "Bookworm Adventures Vol.2"

#. Description for music mvz2:dream_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦境世界关卡的音乐。\n"
"欢迎来到梦境世界，也欢迎来到《书虫大冒险》的二代。\n"
"在Lex穿梭于三本书后，他又再次遇到了问题。这次它穿梭的三本书，分别是——童话故"
"事、中国神话，以及科幻故事。\n"
"而这首音乐则来源于第四本书——童话故事，游戏内也称《破碎的童话》。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Dream World.\n"
"Welcome to the Dream World, and welcome to <i>Bookworm Adventures Vol. 2</"
"i>.\n"
"After traveling through three books, Lex encounters yet another challenge. "
"This time, the three books Lex journeys through are Fairy Tales, Chinese "
"Mythology, and Science Fiction.\n"
"This theme comes from the fourth book—Fairy Tales, referred to in-game as "
"<i>Fractured Fairy Tales</i>."

#. Name for music mvz2:dream_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "破碎的童话-地图"
msgstr "Fractured Fairytales Map"

#. Description for music mvz2:dream_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦境世界地图的音乐。\n"
"《破碎的童话》这本书包含了大量的童话故事和歌谣，《三只小猪》啊，《金发姑娘与"
"三只熊》啊，还有最著名的《爱丽丝梦游仙境》。\n"
"如此多的童话角色，Lex都与他们进行了梦幻般的战斗。\n"
"如同这美丽的梦境世界一样。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Dream World.\n"
"<i>Fractured Fairy Tales</i> features a wealth of classic tales and nursery "
"rhymes—<i>The Three Little Pigs</i>, <i>Goldilocks and the Three Bears</i>, "
"and the most iconic of all, <i>Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland</i>.\n"
"Lex engages in fantastical battles with these countless fairy tale "
"characters,\n"
"much like the beauty of the Dream World itself."

#. Name for music mvz2:suspension
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "悬念"
msgstr "Suspension"

#. Source for music mvz2:suspension
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "逆转裁判"
msgstr "Ace Attorney"

#. Description for music mvz2:suspension
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"剧情音乐。\n"
"常用在紧张时刻的音乐。"
msgstr ""
"Lore theme.\n"
"Theme commonly used in tense moments."

#. Name for music mvz2:nightmare_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "以撒的结合"
msgstr "The Binding of Isaac"

#. Source for music mvz2:nightmare_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "以撒的结合"
msgstr "The Binding of Isaac"

#. Description for music mvz2:nightmare_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"噩梦世界地图的音乐。\n"
"来源于Roguelike游戏《以撒的结合》的Flash版，是它的主界面音乐。\n"
"内容十分丰富的游戏，剧情也相当有深度：家庭暴力、父母离异，这些因素让5岁的孩子"
"——以撒的童年变成了一场噩梦。\n"
"来吧，如同这噩梦世界一样，窒息而死吧。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Nightmare World.\n"
"It originates from the Flash version of the roguelike game <i>The Binding of "
"Isaac</i>, serving as its main menu theme.\n"
"This is a richly detailed game with a deeply layered narrative: themes of "
"domestic violence, parental divorce, and other factors turn the childhood of "
"Isaac, a five-year-old boy, into a living nightmare.\n"
"Come, suffocate in its despair, just like this Nightmare World."

#. Name for music mvz2:nightmare_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "忏悔"
msgstr "Repentant"

#. Description for music mvz2:nightmare_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"噩梦世界关卡的音乐。\n"
"来源于Roguelike游戏《以撒的结合》的Flash版，是洞穴层的音乐。\n"
"当年的那个5岁的孩子，把自己关在一个箱子中，让这箱子内的小小空间，随着他的想象"
"成为他的大世界。\n"
"只是，那箱子里在逐渐消散的，不止有他的想象，还有他的生命。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Nightmare World.\n"
"It originates from the Flash version of the roguelike game <i>The Binding of "
"Isaac</i>, specifically the theme for the Caves level.\n"
"That five-year-old child from back then locked himself inside a chest, "
"turning the tiny space within into his vast world through the power of his "
"imagination.\n"
"However, what gradually fades away inside that chest is not just his "
"imagination, but also his life."

#. Name for music mvz2:nightmare_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "飞翔于宇宙的不可思议巫女"
msgstr "The Mysterious Shrine Maiden Flying Through Space"

#. Source for music mvz2:nightmare_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "东方绀珠传"
msgstr "Legacy of Lunatic Kingdom"

#. Description for music mvz2:nightmare_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"噩梦世界最终关的音乐。\n"
"是《东方绀珠传》的第三关关卡音乐，也是哆来咪战斗前的音乐。\n"
"哆来咪受到梦魇侵蚀，生命垂危。史蒂夫明明可以逃离，但为了她，不惜一切要杀死那"
"个梦魇。和这首曲子一样，充满了悲壮。\n"
"等着吧，哆来咪，我们绝对会把你救出来的。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Nightmare World.\n"
"It is the Stage 3 theme from <i>Legacy of Lunatic Kingdom</i>, also serving "
"as the pre-battle theme for Doremy.\n"
"Doremy, cursed by Nightmare, is on the brink of death. Steve could have "
"escaped, but for her sake, he is determined to destroy the nightmare at any "
"cost. Like this piece of theme, the moment is filled with tragic heroism.\n"
"Just wait, Doremy. We will absolutely save you."

#. Name for music mvz2:nightmare_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Pandemonic Planet（前段）"
msgstr "Pandemonic Planet (1st part)"

#. Description for music mvz2:nightmare_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦魇第一阶段的音乐。\n"
"是《东方绀珠传》的Extra关Boss——赫卡提亚的音乐。\n"
"之前的版本中，它的音乐也是来自《以撒的结合》中的一首音乐。之后我偶然听到了这"
"首音乐，觉得这首音乐更加符合这场战斗的情景，于是便换了。\n"
"至今还有很多人对我的这个改动不满意。不过既然都改了，就让它去吧。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the phase 1 of Nightmare.\n"
"It is the theme of Hecatia, the Extra Stage Boss from <i>Legacy of Lunatic "
"Kingdom</i>.\n"
"In earlier versions, I used a track from <i>The Binding of Isaac</i>. Later, "
"I happened to hear this piece and felt it better suited the atmosphere of "
"the battle, so I made the switch.\n"
"Even though many people are still dissatisfied with this change, since it’s "
"already done, let it be."

#. Name for music mvz2:nightmare_boss2
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Pandemonic Planet（后段）"
msgstr "Pandemonic Planet (2nd part)"

#. Description for music mvz2:nightmare_boss2
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦魇第二阶段的音乐。\n"
"是《东方绀珠传》的Extra关Boss——赫卡提亚的音乐的后半段。\n"
"虽然这首音乐已经不再是《以撒的结合》的音乐了，不过其实有个冷知识：\n"
"梦魇收割者的一部分设计来源于《以撒的结合：忏悔》中的教条。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the phase 2 of Nightmare.\n"
"It is the latter half of Hecatia's theme, the Extra Stage Boss from "
"<i>Legacy of Lunatic Kingdom</i>.\n"
"Although this theme is no longer from <i>The Binding of Isaac</i>, here’s a "
"little-known fact:\n"
"Part of the Nightmare Reaper’s design is inspired by Dogma from <i>The "
"Binding of Isaac: Repentance</i>."

#. Name for music mvz2:Sacrificial
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Sacrificial(牺牲)"
msgstr "Sacrificial"

#. Description for music mvz2:Sacrificial
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"噩梦世界拓展Boss战的道中音乐，也是mvz2_gms2版本噩梦世界最终关的道中音乐，老玩"
"家们应该都听懂了\n"
"来源以撒的结合的地下室层音乐。\n"
"冰与冷知识时间到\n"
"很早就玩b站看pvz视频的朋友们可能知道有个叫做超级滑稽的up主，他制作的诅咒系列"
"当时，在圈内可是大有名气，甚至掀起过其他人跟风模仿的自制诅咒关卡实况。\n"
"当时超级滑稽视频配乐就多用这个bgm，这大概也是因为他是一位MVZ2爱好者。"
msgstr ""
"The mid-level track for the Nightmare World EXPAND Boss fight. It's also the "
"mid-level music for the final stage of the Nightmare World in the MVZ2 GMS2 "
"version. Veteran players should recognize it.\n"
"Source: The Basement theme from The Binding of Isaac."

#. Name for music mvz2:gensokyo_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "青空之影"
msgstr "A Shadow in the Blue Sky"

#. Source for music mvz2:gensokyo_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "东方星莲船"
msgstr "Undefined Fantastic Object"

#. Description for music mvz2:gensokyo_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"幻想乡和香霖堂的音乐。\n"
"是《东方星莲船》的主界面音乐。\n"
"击败了那梦魇，史蒂夫他们便来到了幻想乡。\n"
"这幻想乡真如戴夫所说，是一片美好的世外桃源。\n"
"……也是我们这些被现实的压力压垮的人的暂歇之所。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for Gensokyo and Kourindou.\n"
"This is the main menu theme in <i>Undefined Fantastic Object</i>.\n"
"The Nightmare is defeated, Steve and Dave finally arrived at Gensokyo.\n"
"Gensokyo, as Dave said, is a beautiful paradise.\n"
"...It is also a resting place for those of us, who are crushed by the "
"pressure of reality."

#. Name for music mvz2:distress
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "记忆的回响"
msgstr "Fading Echoes of Memory"

#. Source for music mvz2:distress
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "原创"
msgstr "Original"

#. Author for music mvz2:distress
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.author"
msgid "幻梦忧"
msgstr "幻梦忧"

#. Description for music mvz2:distress
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"剧情音乐。\n"
"已经过去十几年了，我离童年那些美好的记忆越来越远。\n"
"我想回到当年玩植物大战僵尸的时候。\n"
"我想回到当年更加纯粹的时光。\n"
"我想回到过去，找回那些逝去的记忆。\n"
"可是真的有人能这么做吗？"
msgstr ""
"Lore theme.\n"
"It’s been over a decade now, and those beautiful childhood memories feel "
"increasingly distant.\n"
"I want to return to the days when I played Plants vs. Zombies.\n"
"I want to return to simpler, more innocent times.\n"
"I want to go back and reclaim those faded memories.\n"
"But is there really anyone who can do that?"

#. Name for music mvz2:castle_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "沉默空洞的辉针城"
msgstr "The Shining Needle Castle Sinking to the Void"

#. Source for music mvz2:castle_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "东方辉针城"
msgstr "Double Dealing Character"

#. Origin for music mvz2:castle_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "沉向空中的辉针城"
msgstr "The Shining Needle Castle Sinking in the Air"

#. Description for music mvz2:castle_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"辉针城地图的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方辉针城》第五关的音乐《沉向天空的辉针城》，感谢幻梦忧帮我制作这个"
"版本。\n"
"这辉针城不知为何没有多少人存在，是那些凋灵骷髅干的吗？\n"
"不过，似乎还有一种东西在这辉针城中消失了。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Shining Needle Castle.\n"
"The original theme is the 5th stage theme <i>The Shining Needle Castle "
"Sinking to the Sky</i> in <i>Double Dealing Character</i>, thanks 幻梦忧 for "
"making this remix.\n"
"We don't know why there aren't many people in this castle. Did those wither "
"skeletons do it?\n"
"However, it seems that there is something else that has disappeared in this "
"empty castle."

#. Name for music mvz2:castle_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "凋灵舞曲"
msgstr "Witherstep"

#. Source for music mvz2:castle_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "Minecraft"
msgstr "Minecraft"

#. Origin for music mvz2:castle_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "Pigstep"
msgstr "Pigstep"

#. Description for music mvz2:castle_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"辉针城关卡的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《Minecraft》唱片《Pigstep》。\n"
"如今小人族们已不见踪影，城内到处都是下界生物们的影子。\n"
"呵呵，这凋灵骷髅还挺狡猾，偷来了猪灵们的唱片，然后制作了这首……“山寨音乐”。\n"
"也就欺负欺负猪灵们没有能力反抗了。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Shining Needle Castle.\n"
"The original theme is the disc <i>Pigstep</i> in <i>Minecraft</i>.\n"
"Nowadays, the inchlings have disappeared from their home, instead the mobs "
"from the Nether are everywhere in the castle.\n"
"Hehe, wither skeletons are quite cunning. They stole piglin's discs, and "
"made this... \"Counterfeit theme\".\n"
"Just taking advantage of the fact that the piglins can’t fight back anymore."

#. Name for music mvz2:phone_ring
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "有只僵尸在你的手机里"
msgstr "Zombies in your phone"

#. Origin for music mvz2:phone_ring
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "有只僵尸在你的草坪上"
msgstr "Zombies on your lawn"

#. Description for music mvz2:phone_ring
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"剧情音乐。\n"
"原曲是《植物大战僵尸》的结尾曲《有只僵尸在你的草坪上》。\n"
"你电话响了。"
msgstr ""
"Lore theme.\n"
"The original theme is the ending theme <i>Zombies on Your Lawn</i> of "
"<i>Plants Vs. Zombies</i>.\n"
"Your phone calls."

#. Name for music mvz2:seija
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Reverse Ideology"
msgstr "Reverse Ideology"

#. Description for music mvz2:seija
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"鬼人正邪的音乐。\n"
"是《东方辉针城》中第五关Boss——鬼人正邪的音乐。\n"
"一切都倒过来了！"
msgstr ""
"The theme for Seija Kijin battle.\n"
"This is the theme for Seija Kijin in <i>Double Dealing Character</i>.\n"
"Everything is reversed!"

#. Name for music mvz2:sad_shinmyoumaru
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "针折线断的天守阁"
msgstr "The Exacerbated Castle Keep"

#. Origin for music mvz2:sad_shinmyoumaru
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "针小棒大的天守阁"
msgstr "The Exaggerated Castle Keep"

#. Description for music mvz2:sad_shinmyoumaru
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"剧情音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方辉针城》中第六关关卡，以及Boss——少名针妙丸的音乐。\n"
"言语如同锋芒，扎向城主的心。"
msgstr ""
"Lore theme.\n"
"The melody is from the stage 6 theme <i>The Exaggerated Castle Keep</i>, and "
"the theme of Sukuna Shinmyoumaru in <i>Double Dealing character</i>.\n"
"Words pierce like needles, stinging the heart of the lady."

#. Name for music mvz2:castle_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "辉光之针的小人族 ~ Little Princess"
msgstr "Inchlings of the Shining Needle ~ Little Princess"

#. Description for music mvz2:castle_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"辉针城最终关的音乐。\n"
"是《东方辉针城》中第六关Boss——少名针妙丸的音乐。\n"
"“消灭那些夺走我族人生命的敌人，报这不共戴天之仇吧”\n"
"“这是我唯一剩下的愿望了”"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Shining Needle Castle.\n"
"It is the theme of Sukuna Shinmyoumaru, the Stage 6 Boss in <i>Double "
"Dealing Character</i>.\n"
"\"Perish the enemies who have taken the lives of my people, avenge this "
"irreconcilable hatred.\"\n"
"\"This is my only wish left.\""

#. Name for music mvz2:wither_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "惊疑星球-头目"
msgstr "Astounding Planet Boss"

#. Description for music mvz2:wither_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"凋灵的音乐。\n"
"之前提到过《书虫大冒险 Vol.2》中Lex的故事，我们先跳过第五本书，讲一讲第六本"
"书。\n"
"Lex穿越的第六本书，也是最后一本书，它叫做《惊疑星球》，包括了大量的科幻小说内"
"容。飞船、机器人、变异、时空穿梭……不过，我已经不能再说了。\n"
"因为老大哥在看着我。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for Wither.\n"
"As previously mentioned regarding the story of Lex in <I>Bookworm Adventures "
"Vol. 2</i>, let’s skip the fifth book and focus on the sixth.\n"
"The sixth book that Lex travels through, which is also the final one, is "
"titled <i>Astounding Planet</i>. It incorporates heavy science fiction "
"elements—spaceships, robots, mutations, time travel... But I can’t say any "
"more.\n"
"Because <I>Big Brother</i> is watching me."

#. Name for music mvz2:Dungeon
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Dungeon"
msgstr "Dungeon"

#. Source for music mvz2:Dungeon
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "泰拉瑞亚"
msgstr "Terraria"

#. Description for music mvz2:Dungeon
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"辉针城拓展关的音乐。\n"
"相当刺激和有意思的歌，敲击的鼓点仿佛是骷髅们用肋骨制成的，愤怒的骷髅一波一波"
"的袭来，地牢的探险旅程充满着惊奇。\n"
"有趣的是，这歌曾是gms2旧版辉针城关卡的配乐，现在在EXPAND里重现天日，令人欣喜"
msgstr ""
"The music for the Shining Needle Castle EXPAND Level.\n"
"A pretty intense and exciting track. The percussive drumbeats sound like "
"they could have been made from skeletons' ribs. Waves of furious skeletons "
"keep coming, and the dungeon exploration journey is full of surprises.\n"
"Interestingly, this track was once used as the BGM for the old GMS2 version "
"of Shining Needle Castle, and now it's been brought back to life in EXPAND — "
"a truly delightful revival."

#. Name for music mvz2:mausoleum_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "游魂的夜樱"
msgstr "Night Sakura of the Hollowed"

#. Source for music mvz2:mausoleum_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "东方神灵庙"
msgstr "Ten Desires"

#. Origin for music mvz2:mausoleum_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "死灵的夜樱"
msgstr "Night Sakura of Dead Spirits"

#. Description for music mvz2:mausoleum_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦殿大祀庙地图的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方神灵庙》第一关的音乐《死灵的夜樱》。\n"
"人死，人埋，人有欲望尚存。\n"
"人遂化为僵尸，如游魂般在这世上游荡，心中只剩下一个巨大的空洞。\n"
"唯一能证明自己还存在的，便是那无限的，对于进食的渴求。\n"
"可是，人明明已经死去，这般欲望又有什么意义呢？"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Hall of Dreams' Great Mausoleum.\n"
"The original theme is the 1st stage theme <i>Night Sakura of Dead Spirits</"
"i> in <i>Ten Desires</i>.\n"
"Men die. Men are buried. Yet their desires linger.\n"
"Transformed into zombies, they wander the mortal plane like spectral "
"drifters,\n"
"their hollowed chests cradling cavernous voids.\n"
"\n"
"The only proof of their lingering existence?\n"
"A ceaseless hunger for sustenance—\n"
"though their rotting jaws taste neither blood nor rice.\n"
"\n"
"But when the flesh has long decayed,\n"
"what meaning remains in these earthly hungers?"

#. Name for music mvz2:mausoleum_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "欲望缓步"
msgstr "Desire Stroll"

#. Origin for music mvz2:mausoleum_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "欲望加速"
msgstr "Desire Drive"

#. Author for music mvz2:mausoleum_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.author"
msgid "Dr.糕萌酸钾-Studio"
msgstr "Dr.糕萌酸钾-Studio"

#. Description for music mvz2:mausoleum_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦殿大祀庙关卡的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方神灵庙》第四关的音乐《欲望加速》，感谢Dr.糕萌酸钾-Studio帮我制作"
"这个版本。\n"
"这里虽然充满了欲望，不过似乎也没有什么适合疾驰的地方。\n"
"那就在这里，慢慢地散个步吧。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Hall of Dreams' Great Mausoleum.\n"
"The original theme is the 4th stage theme <i>Desire Drive</i> in <i>Ten "
"Desires</i>, thanks Dr.糕萌酸钾-Studio for making this remix.\n"
"Though this place is filled with desires, there seems to be no suitable path "
"for driving.\n"
"Let's just take a leisurely stroll here instead."

#. Name for music mvz2:puzzle
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "脑力激战"
msgstr "Cerebrawl"

#. Description for music mvz2:puzzle
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"解谜模式的音乐。\n"
"该敲哪个罐子？\n"
"该放什么僵尸？"
msgstr ""
"The theme for puzzle games.\n"
"Which vase should I break?\n"
"Which zombie should I place?"

#. Name for music mvz2:mausoleum_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "圣德传说 ~ True Administrator"
msgstr "Shoutoku Legend ~ True Administrator"

#. Description for music mvz2:mausoleum_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"梦殿大祀庙最终关的音乐。\n"
"是《东方神灵庙》中第六关Boss——丰聪耳神子的音乐。\n"
"作为一名真正的领导者，她指引人民，走向了辉煌的未来。\n"
"然而，再光明的时代，其最后也难逃衰落的命运。\n"
"古代王朝因傲慢而衰败的事迹数不胜数，而在如今的现代，这种缩影慢慢投射到了各种"
"作品的创作中。\n"
"就如同领导者和他的人民一样，如果我不再听取那些支持我的人的，有相当价值的意"
"见，甚至不把这些人放在眼里，就算我做的再好，那又有什么用呢？"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Hall of Dreams' Great Mausoleum.\n"
"It is the theme of Toyosatomimi no Miko, the Stage 6 Boss in <i>Ten Desires</"
"i>.\n"
"As a true visionary leader, she guided her people towards a glorious "
"future.\n"
"Yet even the brightest era ultimately succumbs to decline.\n"
"History abounds with countless examples of ancient dynasties crumbling due "
"to arrogance, and in modern times, this archetype has gradually been "
"reflected in contemporary artistic creations.\n"
"Just as with leaders and their people: If I cease to listen to the valuable "
"perspectives of those who support me, or worse, dismiss them entirely, what "
"meaning remains in my achievements—no matter how remarkable—without their "
"voices?"

#. Name for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "进化恶魔"
msgstr "Evolution Devil"

#. Source for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "洛克人X5/洛克人"
msgstr "Mega Man X5 / Mega Man"

#. Origin for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "暗影恶魔/威利博士关卡头目"
msgstr "Shadow Devil / Dr. Wily Stage Boss"

#. Description for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"巨人的音乐。\n"
"是《洛克人X5》的头目音乐《Shadow Devil》，以及《洛克人》初代的音乐《Dr. Wily "
"Stage Boss》。\n"
"分别作为头目“暗影恶魔”，以及“黄色恶魔”的主题曲。\n"
"<b>这两名头目也是巨人的主要设计来源。</b>\n"
"你走进头目的房间，却发现房间内空无一人。\n"
"令人恐惧，而又怀念的回忆。"
msgstr ""
"The theme of The Giant.\n"
"The 2 versions are \"Shadow Devil\" (from Mega Man X5) and \"Dr. Wily Stage "
"Boss\" (from Mega Man).\n"
"These serve as the themes for the bosses \"Shadow Devil\" and \"Yellow "
"Devil\", respectively.\n"
"<b>These two bosses are also the primary design inspirations for The Giant.</"
"b>\n"
"You enter the boss room, only to find it empty.\n"
"A terrifying, yet nostalgic memory."

#. Name for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss_2
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Lamdabamda"
msgstr "Lamdabamda"

#. Source for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss_2
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "洛克人X5"
msgstr "Mega Man X5"

#. Description for music mvz2:mausoleum_boss_2
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"巨人第三阶段的音乐。\n"
"是《洛克人X5》的头目音乐《Lamdabamda》，作为头目“Rangda Bangda”的主题曲。\n"
"房间里是一副奇怪的壁画，整个房间内充斥着神秘的压迫感。\n"
"而最后，这压迫感会将你推向深渊。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for The Giant’s third phase.\n"
"It is \"Lamdabamda\" (from Mega Man X5), serving as the theme for the boss "
"\"Rangda Bangda.\"\n"
"The room features a strange mural, filled with an eerie, oppressive "
"atmosphere.\n"
"In the end, this oppressive force pushes you toward the abyss."

#. Name for music mvz2:ship_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "美猴王-地图"
msgstr "Monkey King Map"

#. Description for music mvz2:ship_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"圣辇船地图的音乐。\n"
"《书虫大冒险 Vol.2》中，当主角Lex从童话中回到图书馆后，邪恶Lex突然出现，夺走"
"了魔法钢笔，并把他拉入了第五本书——《美猴王》。\n"
"这本书中充斥着大量的有着中国元素的敌人：猛兽、神话、生肖、鬼怪……内容十分惊"
"艳。\n"
"这也是我最喜欢的一本书。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Palanquin Ship.\n"
"In <i>Bookworm Adventures Vol. 2</i>, after Lex returns to The Great Library "
"from Fractured Fairytales, EviLex suddenly appeared and stole the Magic Pen, "
"then drags him into Book 5—<i>The Monkey King</i>.\n"
"This book is filled with enemies featuring numerous Chinese elements: "
"mythical beasts, mythology, zodiac, ghosts... The contents are truly "
"amazing.\n"
"This is also my favorite book."

#. Name for music mvz2:ship_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "晴空中的UFO恋曲"
msgstr "UFO Romance in the Sunny Sky"

#. Origin for music mvz2:ship_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "夜空中的UFO恋曲"
msgstr "UFO Romance in the Night Sky"

#. Description for music mvz2:ship_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"圣辇船关卡的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方星莲船》Extra关的音乐《夜空中的UFO恋曲》。\n"
"晴空一片，万里无云——哦抱歉，云还是有的。\n"
"史蒂夫踏上了这艘飞在空中的船，开始了他新的征程。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Palanquin Ship.\n"
"The original soundtrack is <i>UFO Romance in the Night Sky</i> from the "
"extra stage of <i>Undefined Fantastic Object</i>.\n"
"The sky is clear, without a single cloud—oh, sorry, there are still some "
"clouds.\n"
"Steve boards this ship flying through the air and set sail on his new "
"journey."

#. Name for music mvz2:ship_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "魔界地方都市秘境"
msgstr "Rural Makai City Esoteria"

#. Description for music mvz2:ship_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"圣辇船最终关的音乐。\n"
"是《东方星莲船》中第五关的音乐。\n"
"天空阴云密布，船上却阳光直射。\n"
"有的人一辈子活在亲人死亡的阴影中，有的人则活在万人赞颂的光芒之下。\n"
"下面的人想飞上来，上面的人却也想落下去。\n"
"然而，这重重阴云把他们隔开，怎么也无法如愿。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Palanquin Ship.\n"
"This soundtrack is from the fifth stage of <i>Undefined Fantastic Object</"
"i>.\n"
"The sky was overcast, yet the ship basked in sunlight.\n"
"One has lived their entire life in the shadow of its loved one's death, "
"while the other has lived in the light of a thousand praises.\n"
"The one below yearns for the sky, while the one above dreams to land.\n"
"Yet the dense clouds lay between them, no matter how much they desire."

#. Name for music mvz2:ship_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "美猴王-头目"
msgstr "Monkey King Boss"

#. Description for music mvz2:ship_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"红龙的音乐。\n"
"在《书虫大冒险 Vol.2》中，主角Lex在《美猴王》这本书中击败了强大的敌人，得到了"
"许多珍贵的宝物，结识了黄飞鸿和美猴王这两位同伴，并最终击败了四大天王和二郎"
"神，到达了天庭。\n"
"玉皇大帝告诉他，Lex的旅程尚未结束，他们发现了一种威胁，一种威胁到所有书中世界"
"的威胁。Lex觉得这是邪恶Lex所为，但玉皇大帝却认为，Lex无法击败邪恶Lex。\n"
"最终，Lex离开了这本书，再次回到了图书馆。"
msgstr ""
"The Red Dragon's theme.\n"
"In Bookworm <i>Adventures Vol. 2</i>, the protagonist Lex defeated powerful "
"enemies, obtained many precious treasures, and befriended Wong Fei Hong and "
"the Monkey King in the book The Monkey King. Together, they ultimately "
"defeated the Four Heavenly Kings and Er-lang Shen, reaching heaven.\n"
"The Jade Emperor told Lex that his journey is not over yet, as they had "
"discovered a threat that endangers all the worlds in the book. Lex suspected "
"that EviLex must be behind this, but the Jade Emperor believed that Lex "
"couldn't defeat EviLex.\n"
"In the end, Lex left the book and returned to the library once again."

#. Name for music mvz2:Lava_Chicken
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "岩浆烤鸡歌"
msgstr "Lava Chicken"

#. Description for music mvz2:Lava_Chicken
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"玩家/村民相关小游戏的音乐。\n"
"希望诸位在听到这首曲子时能想起被史蒂夫和村民支配的恐惧\n"
"\n"
"La-la-la-lava, ch-ch-ch-chicken\n"
"Steve's Lava Chicken, yeah, it's tasty as hell\n"
"Ooh, mamacita, now you're ringing the bell\n"
"Crispy and juicy, now you're having a snack\n"
"Ooh, super spicy, it's a lava attack"
msgstr ""
"Music for Mannequin/Villager-related minigames.\n"
"May this piece remind you of the fear of being dominated by Steve and the "
"Villager.\n"
"\n"
"La-la-la-lava, ch-ch-ch-chicken\n"
"Steve's Lava Chicken, yeah, it's tasty as hell\n"
"Ooh, mamacita, now you're ringing the bell\n"
"Crispy and juicy, now you're having a snack\n"
"Ooh, super spicy, it's a lava attack"

#. Name for music mvz2:palace_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "惊疑星球-地图"
msgstr "Astounding Planet Map"

#. Description for music mvz2:palace_map
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"地灵殿地图的音乐。\n"
"在《书虫大冒险 Vol.2》中，主角Lex离开《美猴王》，回到了图书馆，却发现图书馆中"
"出现了大量的机器人，它们偷走了图书馆的书。\n"
"Lex和他的同伴们跟着机器人冲进了一本书中，那本书即为《惊疑星球》。"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the map of Palace of the Earth Spirits.\n"
"In Bookworm <i>Adventure Vol. 2</i>, the protagonist Lex leaves <i>The "
"Monkey King</i> and returns to the library, only to discover a large number "
"of robots have appeared and are stealing the library's books.\n"
"Lex and his companions pursue the robots into a book, which is <i>Astounding "
"Planet</i>."

#. Name for music mvz2:palace_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "异常之眼"
msgstr "Eye of Anomaly"

#. Source for music mvz2:palace_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.source"
msgid "东方地灵殿"
msgstr "Subterranean Animism"

#. Origin for music mvz2:palace_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.origin"
msgid "少女觉 ～ 3rd eye"
msgstr "Satori Maiden ~ 3rd eye"

#. Description for music mvz2:palace_level
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"地灵殿关卡的音乐。\n"
"原曲是《东方地灵殿》中古明地 觉的音乐《少女觉 ～ 3rd eye》。\n"
"地灵殿一如既往的深邃而又华丽。\n"
"然而，此时的地灵殿却似乎出现了很多奇怪的东西。\n"
"奇怪的……■■■■■■？"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the levels of Palace of the Earth Spirits.\n"
"The original theme is <i>Satori Maiden ~ 3rd Eye</i>, the theme of Satori "
"Komeiji from <i>Subterranean Animism</i>.\n"
"The Palace of the Earth Spirits remains as profound and magnificent as "
"ever.\n"
"However, at this moment, it seems that many strange things have appeared "
"here.\n"
"Strange... ██████?"

#. Name for music mvz2:palace_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Last Remote"
msgstr "Last Remote"

#. Description for music mvz2:palace_final
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"地灵殿最终关的音乐。\n"
"是《东方地灵殿》中Extra关的音乐。\n"
"随着无数的灵魂在地灵殿不断飞舞，这场袭击的凶手似乎马上就要来临了。\n"
"那位夺走他人记忆与灵魂的“猎手”啊，出来与我们一战吧！"
msgstr ""
"The theme for the final level of Palace of the Earth Spirits.\n"
"It is the theme from the extra stage of <i>Subterranean Animism</i>.\n"
"As countless souls continue to fly around the Palace of the Earth Spirits, "
"it seems that the culprit behind this attack is about to arrive.\n"
"O \"Hunter\" who steals the memories and souls of others', come out and "
"fight us!"

#. Name for music mvz2:palace_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.name"
msgid "Boss 2"
msgstr "Boss 2"

#. Description for music mvz2:palace_boss
#: Music meta file
msgctxt "music.description"
msgid ""
"上锁的箱子的音乐。\n"
"是游戏《泰拉瑞亚》中Boss血肉之墙的音乐。\n"
"！！！恐惧！！！\n"
"不可名状的巨型血肉墙壁正在朝你冲过来！！！！！"
msgstr ""
"The theme of Locked Chest.\n"
"It is the theme of the Wall of Flesh from <i>Terraria</i>.\n"
"!!!FEAR!!!\n"
"An indescribable, gigantic wall of flesh is charging toward you!!!!!"

