#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "Whaddaya Buyin'?"
msgstr "Whaddaya Buyin'?"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "我吃地上的东西！"
msgstr "I eat things off the floor!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "倒吊人今天会带给你好运！"
msgstr "A hanged man brings you luck today!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "你根本不知道在海的这边泥土有多值钱！"
msgstr "You have no idea how much Dirt Blocks sell on this side of the sea!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "周三打烊！"
msgstr "Closed on Wednesdays!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "一个人前进太危险了，把你的钱都给我吧！"
msgstr "It's dangerous to go alone! Give me all your money!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "这个地毯可是非卖品！"
msgstr "This rug is not for sale!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "有人放彩色石头的悬崖下面通常有好东西！"
msgstr "Cliffs with some rainbow rubbles usually hide treasures below!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "以后能教教我这些机器怎么用吗？"
msgstr "Could you teach me how to use these machines sometime?"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "要读读看这本书吗？很有趣的！"
msgstr "Wanna give this book a try? It’s really interesting!"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "听说，外界的公主一旦陷入危机，就会有一位骑士前来救她呢。"
msgstr ""
"I heard that in the outside world, when a princess is in trouble, a knight "
"always comes to rescue her."

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "你们那里的人都是方形的吗？"
msgstr "Are all the people from your world cubic?"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "虽然这里存在着危险的妖怪，不过像我一样比较弱的妖怪还是更多呢。"
msgstr ""
"Even though there are dangerous youkai here, there are actually more weaker "
"ones like me."

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "科幻故事我看不懂，我还是更喜欢童话故事一点……"
msgstr "I can’t really get into sci-fi stories. I prefer fairy tales more…"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "嗯？这个不是切菜用的砧板？"
msgstr "Hmm? Isn’t this a cutting board for chopping vegetables?"

#. Store chat from character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "发射器为什么长着一张这么可爱的脸呢？"
msgstr "Why do dispensers have such a cute face?"

#. Store item description of mvz2:blueprint_slot by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "额外的蓝图槽！让你能在战斗中多携带一个器械！"
msgstr ""
"Extra blueprint slot! Allows you to carry one more contraption to battle!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:blueprint_slot by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "这个是额外的蓝图槽，可以让你多带一个器械！"
msgstr ""
"This is an extra blueprint slot, it allows you to carry one more contraption!"

#. Store item text of mvz2:blueprint_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "7 槽"
msgstr "7 Slots"

#. Store item text of mvz2:blueprint_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "8 槽"
msgstr "8 Slots"

#. Store item text of mvz2:blueprint_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "9 槽"
msgstr "9 Slots"

#. Store item text of mvz2:blueprint_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "10 槽"
msgstr "10 Slots"

#. Store item description of mvz2:starshard_slot by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "更多的星之碎片槽！让你的器械爆发吧！"
msgstr "More Starshard slots! Let your contraptions evoke more!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:starshard_slot by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "这个可以让你多带一些很神奇的东西，据说器械们很喜欢呢！"
msgstr ""
"This lets you carry more magical stuff—they say contraptions absolutely "
"adore these!"

#. Store item text of mvz2:starshard_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "4 槽"
msgstr "4 Slots"

#. Store item text of mvz2:starshard_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "5 槽"
msgstr "5 Slots"

#. Store item description of mvz2:artifact_slot by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "更多的制品槽！让你能带更多亮闪闪的小玩意！"
msgstr ""
"Additional artifact slots! Decorate yourself by more precious trinkets!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:artifact_slot by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "这个可以让你带更多的小装饰品！我可喜欢打扮了！"
msgstr ""
"This'll let you pack more fancy trinkets! Accessorizing is my favorite, you "
"know!"

#. Store item text of mvz2:artifact_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "2 槽"
msgstr "2 Slots"

#. Store item text of mvz2:artifact_slot
#: Store meta file
msgid "3 槽"
msgstr "3 Slots"

#. Store item description of mvz2:obsidian_first_aid by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "黑曜石修复术！可以在防御性器械上再放一个同样的器械，以此来完全修复它！"
msgstr ""
"Obsidian First Aid! You can place another identical defensive contraption on "
"the existing one to fully repair it!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:obsidian_first_aid by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"修复器械们的神奇技术！可以在防御性器械上再放一个同样的器械，来把它完全修好！"
msgstr ""
"A magical technique to repair contraptions! You can place another identical "
"defensive contraption on the existing one to fully repair it!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:satori_detector by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "我专门研发的觉眼探测器！可以用于查看器械和怪物的血量！"
msgstr ""
"My specially developed Satori Detector! It lets you check the health points "
"of contraptions and monsters!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:satori_detector by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "神奇的头戴眼镜！可以用于查看器械和怪物的血量！"
msgstr ""
"A pair of magical goggles! It lets you see how much health contraptions and "
"monsters have!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:Snipenser by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把狙击发射器放在发射器上，让其能够向四面八方发射骇人的子弹！"
msgstr ""
"Place the Snipenser on top of a Dispenser to let it fire terrifying bullets "
"in all directions!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:Snipenser by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "狙击发射器能升级发射器，可以向四面八方发射高级的子弹！"
msgstr ""
"The Snipenser upgrades the Dispenser, allowing it to fire advanced bullets "
"in all directions!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:AntiGravityPad by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"把反重力板放在重力板上，其能够吹飞上方怪物，驱动时还可使受它影响的怪物的装备"
"极大受损。"
msgstr ""
"Stick the Anti-Gravity Pad on top of a Gravity Pad — it'll blow away "
"monsters above it, and when triggered, it'll wreck their gear real bad!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:AntiGravityPad by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"反重力板能升级重力板，能够吹飞上方怪物，驱动时还可使受它影响的怪物的装备极大"
"受损，很方便！"
msgstr ""
"Placing the Anti-Gravity Pad on a Gravity Pad allows it to blow away "
"monsters above it. When triggered, it also severely damages the equipment of "
"affected monsters — very convenient!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:infectenser by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把传染发射器放在小型发射器上，让它发射的子弹能够在敌人之间传播！"
msgstr ""
"Place Infectensers on your Small Dispensers. Projectiles shot by them can "
"spread between enemies!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:infectenser by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "传染发射器能升级小型发射器，这样它就能在怪物之间散播互相攻击的种子了！"
msgstr ""
"Infectenser is upgraded from a Small Dispenser. It fires parasitic micro-"
"bots that can spread to nearby foes!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:force_pad by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把传动力板放在重力板上，让它能够操纵上方子弹和敌人的位置！"
msgstr ""
"Place Force Pads on your Gravity Pads. They can control the motion of "
"objects over them!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:force_pad by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "传动力板能升级重力板，能改变很多很多东西的位置，很方便！"
msgstr ""
"Force Pad is upgraded from Gravity Pad. It can change the position of many "
"things, very handy!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:golden_dropper by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"把金制投掷器放在木制投掷器上，让它能够发射可以反弹，并产生绿宝石的金球！"
msgstr ""
"Place these on your Wooden Droppers to turn them into Golden Droppers! It "
"drops the golden ball that can bounce into multiple zombies and drops "
"emeralds upon hit!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:golden_dropper by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "金制投掷器能升级木制投掷器，能发出不停弹来弹去，并且可以赚钱的金球！"
msgstr ""
"Golden Dropper can be upgraded from a Wooden Dropper, it fires bouncing "
"golden balls that can make money!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:Eviltombstone by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把邪灵墓碑放在死灵墓碑上！他就可以召唤下界军团征服世界！"
msgstr ""
"Slap the Eviltombstone right on top of the Necrotombstone! Then he'll summon "
"the Nether Legion and TAKE OVER THE WORLD!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:Eviltombstone by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"好邪恶的墓碑！这位是邪灵墓碑！把他放在死灵墓碑先生上面，然后他就可以产出可怕"
"的下界军队啦！"
msgstr ""
"This is the Eviltombstone — a very evil tombstone! Place it on top of the "
"Necrotombstone, and it will summon a terrifying Nether army for you."

#. Store item description of mvz2:skyward_beacon by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把御天信标放在信标上，让它发射从天而降的致命光束，打击你所指定的位置！"
msgstr ""
"Place Skyward Beacons on your Beacons. They can strike certain spots set by "
"you, with their deadly light beams!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:skyward_beacon by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "御天信标能升级信标，发射从天而降的光束，打击你想要的任意位置！"
msgstr ""
"Skyward Beacon can be upgraded from a Beacon, it fires light beams, to "
"strike any certain spot as you wish!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:SuperFireworkDispenser by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "把超级烟花发射器放在烟花发射器上，和我一起欣赏美丽的烟火大会！"
msgstr ""
"Stick the Super Firework Launcher on top of the Firework Launcher — and come "
"watch the FIREWORKS SHOW with me!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:SuperFireworkDispenser by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"超级烟花发射器先生可以放在烟花发射器先生身上，并对来袭的空中敌人发射烟花！"
msgstr ""
"Place the Super Firework Launcher on top of the Firework Launcher, and it "
"will launch fireworks at incoming airborne enemies."

#. Store item description of mvz2:HBomb by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"不要问我哪搞来的这家伙，一颗氢弹需要拿一颗原子弹来引燃，氢弹爆炸后会给敌人带"
"来绝对的死亡！"
msgstr ""
"Don't ask me where I got this thing. A hydrogen bomb needs an atomic bomb to "
"ignite it — and when it goes off, it'll bring ABSOLUTE DEATH to our enemies!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:HBomb by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "按“科学道理”讲，氢弹必须用裂变弹引燃，触发后会释放出更多的能量！"
msgstr ""
"According to 'science', a hydrogen bomb must be ignited by a fission bomb. "
"When triggered, it releases even more energy!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:hoe by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "我以前用过的锄头！每场战斗它都能杀死最开始出现的那只怪物！"
msgstr ""
"The hoe I used to use! It can kill the first enemy that appears in every "
"battle!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:hoe by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "村民先生的锄头，每场战斗都能给第一只来的怪物当头一棒！"
msgstr ""
"Mr. Villager's hoe, it can knock out the first enemy that appears in every "
"battle!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:the_creatures_heart by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"科学怪人的怪物的心脏！你的场上每有一个相同的器械，这个器械的能量消耗就会减少"
"5！"
msgstr ""
"The heart of The Creature! For each copy of a contraption you have on the "
"lawn, the cost of this contraption is decreased by 5!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:the_creatures_heart by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"很奇怪的心脏……由于它在渴望同类，你的场上每有一个相同的器械，这个器械的能量消"
"耗就会减少5！"
msgstr ""
"A strange heart...Due to it's yearning for its own kind, for each copy of a "
"contraption you have on the lawn, the cost of this contraption is decreased "
"by 5!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:pagoda_branch by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"产自梦境世界的槐树的树枝！你在开始战斗时额外获得2个星之碎片，但是会出现额外2"
"倍多的怪物！"
msgstr ""
"The branch of a pagoda tree from the Dream World! It gives you 2 starshards "
"to start with in every battle, but there will be 2 more times the monsters!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:pagoda_branch by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"来自槐树上的树枝，战斗开始时它能额外给你2个神奇的碎片，但是也会额外出现2倍多"
"的怪物！"
msgstr ""
"A branch of a pagoda tree, It gives you 2 magical shards to start with in "
"every battle, but there will be 2 more times the enemies!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dark_matter by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "从梦魇身上提取出来的暗物质！器械生产效率翻倍，但是怪物会隐形！"
msgstr ""
"Dark matter extracted from the Nightmare itself! Contraptions produce at "
"twice the speed, but the monsters will become invisible!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dark_matter by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "一种很黑的东西，它能让器械生产效率翻倍，但是你会看不见那些怪物！"
msgstr ""
"Some dark thing that makes contraptions produce at twice the speed, but also "
"makes you unable to see the monsters!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:inverted_mirror by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "我不小心把这个镜子放反了！现在它可以让敌人发射的子弹击中其他敌人了！"
msgstr ""
"I accidentally turned this mirror upside down! Now it can make enemy "
"projectiles hit other enemies!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:inverted_mirror by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "不知道为什么倒过来的镜子……总之它可以让敌人的子弹击中他们自己！"
msgstr ""
"I don't know why this mirror is inverted... Anyway, it can make enemies' "
"projectiles hit themselves!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:nether_star by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "下界之星！每当你使用4次星之碎片，会再次生成一个星之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"The Nether Star! It spawns a starshard for every 4 starshards you have used!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:nether_star by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "闪亮亮的星星！每当你使用4次神奇的碎片，会再次生成一个神奇的碎片！"
msgstr ""
"A shiny star! It spawns a magical shard for every 4 magical shards you have "
"used!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:greedy_vacuum by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "贪婪的吸尘器！可以自动帮你收集能量掉落物和星之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"Greedy Vacuum! It can automatically help you collect dropped energy pickups "
"and starshards!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:greedy_vacuum by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "看起来很饿的吸尘器……可以自动帮你吸取粉尘和神奇的碎片！"
msgstr ""
"It looks like a very hungry vacuum... it can automatically suck up dust and "
"magical shards for you!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:eye_of_the_giant by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "巨人的眼睛！你的器械造成的伤害变为两倍半，但是攻击速度也会减半！"
msgstr ""
"Eye of the Giant! Your contraptions' damage is a half more than doubled, but "
"their attack speed is halved!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:eye_of_the_giant by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "有点吓人的大眼睛……它能让你的器械造成巨额伤害，但是攻击速度会变慢许多！"
msgstr ""
"A big scary eye...It can make your contraptions deal massive damage, but "
"attack much more slowly!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dowsing_rods by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "探宝棒！可以让你从怪物身上搜刮出一些战利品！"
msgstr "Dowsing Rods! Makes you can scrape some loot from monsters!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dowsing_rods by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "老鼠的探宝棒！可以让你从怪物们身上得到一些额外的东西！"
msgstr ""
"The mouse's Dowsing Rods! You can get some extra things from the monsters!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dragon_tooth by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "红龙的牙齿！受重伤的敌人会受到两倍伤害！"
msgstr ""
"The red dragon's tooth! Enemies who are seriously damaged will receive twice "
"the damage!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:dragon_tooth by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "红龙掉下来的牙齿！如果一个敌人受了重伤，它会受到更多的伤害！"
msgstr ""
"The red dragon's fallen tooth! If an enemy is seriously damaged, it will "
"suffer even more damage!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:ghostly_cart by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "一辆废弃的尸体推车！每3分钟都会刷新你的最终防线小车！"
msgstr ""
"A junky ol' corpse cart! It reloads your final defense carts every 3 minutes!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:ghostly_cart by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "偷尸体的猫的小推车！每3分钟都会刷新你的最终防线小车！"
msgstr ""
"A cart owned by the corpse-stealing cat! Your final defense carts will be "
"reloaded every 3 minutes!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:broken_lock by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "上锁箱子的挂锁！当器械受到伤害时，减少它蓝图的充能时间！"
msgstr ""
"It's the padlock on the Locked Chest! When a contraption is damaged, the "
"recharge time of its blueprint will be reduced!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:broken_lock by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "那个可恶箱子的挂锁！当器械受到伤害时，减少它蓝图的充能时间！"
msgstr ""
"It's the padlock on that wretched chest! When a contraption is damaged, the "
"recharge time of its blueprint will be reduced!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:DiamondOre by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"我们老旧的钻石矿在赚钱性能上已经完全超越了金制投掷器，将他放在红石矿上，挖掉"
"并把掉落物带回给我！"
msgstr ""
"Listen up, neighbor! Our outdated Diamond Ore has already COMPLETELY "
"surpassed the Golden Dropper in terms of money-making! So here's the deal: "
"you stick it on top of the Redstone Ore, you mine it, and you bring the "
"goodies back to me, or SO HELP ME I WILL just run you over with a mining "
"truck! VROOM VROOM!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:DiamondOre by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"戴夫先生说这个器械他一般不卖的，现在赔本大甩卖，将钻石矿放在红石矿上，挖掉就"
"能获得钻石！"
msgstr ""
"Mr. Dave says he usually doesn't sell this contraption, but now it's a loss-"
"leader clearance sale! Place the Diamond Ore on top of the Redstone Ore, "
"mine it, and you'll get diamonds!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:EXPANDGiftPack by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "EXPAND大礼包！购买后可以获得所有未完成、找不到机会出场的器械！"
msgstr ""
"EXPAND Mega Pack! Get all the unfinished contraptions — the ones that never "
"got their chance to shine — in one bundle!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:BrainInVat by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"这个器械叫做缸中之脑，放置后能让走进家里的怪物不会攻击你，摧毁他会导致不可逆"
"的可怕后果。——哦对了，你如何证明你不是缸中之脑？"
msgstr ""
"This contraption is called the Brain in a Vat. When placed, it stops "
"monsters that enter your house from ending the game. Destroying it will have "
"irreversible and terrifying consequences. — Oh, and by the way, how do you "
"prove you're not a brain in a vat yourself?"

#. Store item description of mvz2:BrainInVat by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid ""
"好诡异的器械啊....这个器械叫做缸中之脑，听说放置后能让走进你家里的怪物先生不"
"会粗暴对你，但是这个器械被摧毁后会怎么样.....谁也不知道"
msgstr ""
"What a bizarre contraption... It's called the Brain in a Vat. I hear that "
"when placed, it stops monsters from being mean to you when they enter your "
"house... but what happens if this contraption gets destroyed...? No one "
"knows."

#. Store item description of mvz2:cake by character mvz2:crazy_villager
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "蛋糕！在你完成所有内容后，来大吃一顿吧！"
msgstr "Cake! After you finish all the content, come and have a big meal!"

#. Store item description of mvz2:cake by character mvz2:tokiko
#: Store meta file
msgctxt "store_talk"
msgid "蛋糕！在一切都结束之后，来大吃一顿吧！"
msgstr "Cake! After everything is over, come and have a big meal!"

